4. **Integration Strategy:** Jessica Patel to work with Rajiv and Tom to develop a streamlined integration strategy for CI/CD pipelines across AWS and Azure by November 30, 2023.
5. **Marketing Coordination:** Emily Johnson to prepare a marketing brief on the benefits of our cloud offerings for the upcoming client presentation by November 1, 2023.

